<div id="urduTextPath">امام رضا (ع)/آج امامِ رضا شہید ہوئے</div>

<p>aaj imaam-e- raza shaheed huwe<br />
shaah-e- har dosaraa shaheed huwe<br />
seh ke ranj-o- balaa shaheed huwe<br />
khaake zehre daghaa shaheed huwe</p>

<p>shaah ke sab ghulaam rote hai<br />
ham se ruqsat imaam hote hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha jo maamoon rasheed baaniye shar<br />
dushman-e- qaandaan-e- paighambar<br />
tha jo aamaadah zeher dene par<br />
shaah ko phir talab kiya aaqar</p>

<p>sun ke shaah-e- anaam ghar se chale<br />
hoke ruqsat imaam ghar se chale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jab nazar aayi qabr-e- paighambar<br />
hilgaya seene me dil-e- muztar<br />
jaake lipte lahad se phir sarwar<br />
aur kiya ye qitaab roro kar</p>

<p>ek lehza na chain paaya hoo'n<br />
ruqsat e aaqri ko aaya hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>keh ke ruqsat huwe imaam-e- raza<br />
tha madine me tahalka barpa<br />
koi qadmo'n se lipta jaata tha<br />
aur labo'n par kisi ke thi ye sadaa</p>

<p>aye shah-e- ausiyaa qudaa haafiz<br />
aye imaam-e- raza qudaa haafiz<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tay manaazil ko karke phir ek baar<br />
aaye darbaar me shah-e- abraar<br />
uthaa taazeem-e- sheh ko wo makkaar<br />
paas apne bithaa liya zinhaar</p>

<p>tab kaha shaah se ye wo maghroor<br />
aap is waqt khaaiye angoor<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jabr se us laee'n ke waawailaa<br />
khaa ke angoor ko uthe moulaa<br />
poocha mamoon ne chale kis jaa<br />
kaha hazrat ne tu jahaa'n bhejaa</p>

<p>keh ke ye shaah e qaas-o- aam chale<br />
sar pa daale abaa imaam chale<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghar me aakar tadap rahe the imaam<br />
zaher ne kar chuka tha apna kaam<br />
qai jo aayi liyaa jigar to thaam<br />
tha na ek lehza aap ko aaraam</p>

<p>yaas thi bekasi thi ghurbat thi<br />
mere moula pa kya musibat thi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>muztarib the bohat shahe zeejaah<br />
ghash jo taari huwaa imaam pa aah<br />
hichki jo aayi mout ki naagaah<br />
phir kahaa laa ilaaha ilaaallah</p>

<p>tan se rooh-e- raza idhar nikli<br />
qabr se faatema udhar nikli<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aayi'n laashe pe fatima zehra<br />
hai garebaan chaak sar nanga<br />
peet'ti hai ye keh ke sar apna<br />
teri ghurbat pe fatima ho fida</p>

<p>bekasi me pada ye laasha hai<br />
koi tujh par na rone wala hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaj hai us imaam ka maatam<br />
jiska ghurbat me haaye nikla dam<br />
jamma aale aba hai sab baaham<br />
baqar o aur jaffer o kazim</p>

<p>jisne dukh zindagi me paaye hai<br />
uski mayyat pe rone aaye hai</p>